<title>USA: Calif. treasurer to name state underwriting teams.</title>
<headline>Calif. treasurer to name state underwriting teams.</headline>
<dateline>SACRAMENTO, Calif. 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>California Treasurer Matt Fong on Tuesday plans to release the names of the firms selected for the state's underwriting pools, which handle most of its bond issues, his office said on Friday.</p>
<p>A spokesman for Fong said the names of the selected firms would be announced on April 1 when the pools become effective.</p>
<p>For the next two years, the underwriting pools will handle state negotiated bond offerings as well as the debt offerings of state financing authorities and boards.</p>
</text>
